Conclusion 
Computers have come a long way since their invention. They have made our lives easier in countless ways. As they continue to advance by the day, they will continue to change and impact our lives. The new innovations in technology and science such as artificial intelligence, quantum computing, and robotics will change the way we live even more.

While computers have presented numerous positive aspects, their negative effects should be taken into consideration. In my opinion, as long as we use them correctly, computers can benefit humankind and lead us into a brighter future.





